# Drop markdown files here.
#
# Every .md file in this directory is ingested into long-term memory on the next
# `pnpm db:seed`, keyed by content hash — editing a file re-ingests it, leaving
# it alone does nothing.
#
# This directory is committed but its contents are gitignored, so your real
# notes stay out of version control. Remove that rule in .gitignore if you would
# rather they were tracked.
